[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0010","text":"那个，要喝水吗？\n……啊，还是吃点心～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_9999","text":"鹦鹉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0020","text":"hmm——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0030","text":"啊哈～\n是透前辈嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0040","text":"小船的书……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0050","text":"……好像是呢\n四兄妹，正在坐帆船冒险"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0060","text":"喂，你能说“鲑鱼”吗～？\n鲑、鱼～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0070","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0080","text":"冒险啊……\n是有怪物出现之类的感觉……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0090","text":"不是\n是避暑来到乡下……在湖中的岛上露营"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0100","text":"钓钓鱼、游游泳、\n用篝火做饭什么的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0110","text":"嘿……！\n那感觉就是普通的暑假呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0120","text":"是啊\n────但是，在这些孩子眼里看到的是大海"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0130","text":"互相用航海士来称呼对方……\n假装自己在某片海上和海盗战斗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0140","text":"跟我们一样呢\n玩着偶像过家家"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0150","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0160","text":"…………但是\n她们并不是不知道海"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0170","text":"────啊\n忘了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0180","text":"补课……结束了……\n正在……回去……的路上……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0190","text":"作战……会议……\n刚……刚开……始……〇……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_06_0200","text":"OK——"}]
